## Prerequisites

The tooling below is installed on the development machine, one section per
language in use.

{% for lang in languages %}{% if lang == 'python' %}
### Python

- Python {{ python_version }}: `pacman -S python`
- uv: `pacman -S uv`
- ruff: `pacman -S ruff`
{% if python_scaffolding == 'application' %}
- mypy: `pacman -S mypy`
{% endif %}

```bash
uv sync
```

{% elif lang == 'javascript' or lang == 'typescript' %}
### {{ 'Deno' if node_runtime == 'deno' else 'Node.js' }}

{% if node_runtime == 'deno' %}
- Deno: `pacman -S deno`
{% else %}
- Node.js {{ node_version }}: `pacman -S nodejs`
- {{ node_package_manager }}: `pacman -S {{ node_package_manager }}`
{% endif %}
{% if uses_deno and node_runtime != 'deno' %}
- Deno (formatter and linter): `pacman -S deno`
{% endif %}
{% if node_lint == 'biome' %}
- Biome: installed as a devDependency, run via `npx biome`
{% endif %}

{% include 'template/_partials/setup-node.jinja' %}
{% elif lang == 'go' %}
### Go

- Go {{ go_directive }}: `pacman -S go`
- golangci-lint: `pacman -S golangci-lint`
- gosec: `go install github.com/securego/gosec/v2/cmd/gosec@v2`
- govulncheck: `go tool govulncheck` (built into Go 1.24+)

```bash
go mod download
```

{% elif lang == 'rust' %}
### Rust

- Rust {{ rust_version }}: `pacman -S rustup` then `rustup toolchain install {{ rust_version }}`

```bash
cargo build
```

{% elif lang == 'dotnet' %}
### .NET

- .NET SDK {{ dotnet_sdk_version }}: `pacman -S dotnet-sdk`

```bash
dotnet restore
```

{% elif lang == 'tofu' %}
### OpenTofu

- OpenTofu {{ tofu_version }}: `pacman -S opentofu`
- tflint: `pacman -S tflint`
- terraform-docs: `yay -S terraform-docs`

{% include 'template/_partials/setup-tofu.jinja' %}
